      "id": "claim_0d03227528be477a8a56bbb278305b71",
      "statement": "Authentication configuration is env-var driven (AUTH_GATEKEEPERS, DISABLE_PASSWORD_AUTH, CF_ACCESS_AUD/ISS) and deliberately excluded from AdminConfig so a compromised admin session cannot change sign-in providers; DISABLE_PASSWORD_AUTH is ignored when no auth gatekeeper is allowlisted, an anti-lockout rule.",
